#: ../../context.md:1
msgid "Context and caching"
msgstr "Context 与缓存"

#: ../../context.md:3
msgid ""
"Each request contains more than the latest message. minacode puts stable "
"session context first, then sends one append-only conversation log. This "
"keeps the agent informed while giving supported providers exact earlier "
"user and tool boundaries to reuse."
msgstr ""
"每次请求包含的不只是最新消息。minacode 先放置稳定的 session context，再发送一份 append-only "
"对话日志。这样既能让 agent 掌握完整信息，也让支持缓存的 provider 可以精确复用之前的 user 和 tool 边界。"

#: ../../context.md:7
msgid "What the model receives"
msgstr "模型会收到什么"

#: ../../context.md:11
msgid ""
"The environment records the session's start time once as a local ISO "
"timestamp with its numeric offset, such as `2026-07-30T20:34:56+08:00`. "
"Resuming appends a user-role lifecycle event with the new local time. "
"These timestamps are directly readable by both the user and model; no UTC"
" conversion is required, and there is no changing date block inserted "
"into later requests."
msgstr ""
"环境只记录一次 session 开始时间，使用带数字时区偏移的本地 ISO 时间戳，例如 "
"`2026-07-30T20:34:56+08:00`。恢复 session 时，会追加一条包含新本地时间的 user-role "
"生命周期事件。用户和模型都能直接理解这些时间，无需转换 UTC，后续请求中也不会插入不断变化的日期块。"

#: ../../context.md:16
msgid ""
"Tool definitions are sent beside this message stack: built-in tools, "
"`Skill` when skills are installed, and MCP tools and resources from <span"
" class=\"marker\">currently connected servers</span>. Configured but "
"disconnected servers do not consume context."
msgstr ""
"工具定义与消息 context 一同发送：内置工具；安装 skill 后提供 `Skill`；以及来自<span "
"class=\"marker\">当前已连接 server</span>的 MCP 工具和资源。已配置但未连接的 server 不占用 "
"context。"

#: ../../context.md:20
msgid ""
"When a model exposes reasoning, minacode keeps the returned protocol data"
" in the session but only replays what the active provider expects. Some "
"APIs require preserved reasoning across turns; others ignore old "
"reasoning unless a preserved-thinking option is enabled, while still "
"needing it inside a multi-step tool call. Opaque signatures and encrypted"
" reasoning are returned unchanged when their protocol requires them, but "
"are not shown as model-readable text."
msgstr ""
"当模型返回 reasoning 时，minacode 会在 session 中保留协议数据，但只回放当前 provider 所需的内容。部分 "
"API 要求跨轮保留 reasoning；另一些 API 除非启用 preserved-thinking 选项，否则会忽略旧 "
"reasoning，但在多步工具调用期间仍需要它。协议要求时，不透明签名与加密 reasoning 会原样回传，但不会被当作模型可读文本显示。"

#: ../../context.md:26
msgid ""
"When [provider-side search](tools.md#provider-side-tools) is enabled, the"
" pages it reads are added to the context by the provider rather than by "
"minacode, so they are not shortened and the context fill cannot predict "
"them: a turn that searches arrives larger than one that does not, and "
"most providers charge for the search on top of the tokens."
msgstr ""
"启用 [Provider 侧搜索](tools.md#provider-side-tools)后，它读取的网页由 Provider 而非 "
"minacode 加入 context，因此不会被截断，context 占用也无法提前预估：包含搜索的一轮会比不含搜索的更大，而且多数 "
"Provider 会在 token 之外对搜索单独计费。"

#: ../../context.md:31
msgid "Keeping context manageable"
msgstr "控制 context 大小"

#: ../../context.md:33
msgid ""
"Large tool results are shortened before they enter the conversation; the "
"agent can retrieve the complete result later with `Recall`. Repeated "
"skill instructions and MCP descriptions are replaced with references to "
"their first full copy instead of being sent in full again."
msgstr ""
"过大的工具结果进入对话前会被缩短；agent 之后可以通过 `Recall` 取回完整结果。重复的 skill 指令和 MCP "
"描述不会再次完整发送，而是引用首次出现的完整内容。"

#: ../../context.md:37
msgid "Compaction"
msgstr "Compaction"

#: ../../context.md:39
msgid ""
"As the estimated request approaches `runtime.max_context_tokens`, "
"minacode **compacts**: the older part of the conversation is replaced by "
"a short summary, and the most recent messages are kept as they are. The "
"estimate uses the effective Chat, Responses, or Anthropic request, so "
"reasoning that the provider will discard does not cause early compaction."
" The trigger reserves the configured provider output cap (16K when "
"unspecified), tool schemas, and a safety margin of at least 4K. The "
"session continues in the same turn, so a long task does not have to stop."
msgstr ""
"当估算的请求接近 `runtime.max_context_tokens` 时，minacode 会执行 "
"**compact**：较早的对话被替换为简短摘要，最近的消息保持原样。估算基于实际的 Chat、Responses 或 Anthropic "
"请求，因此 provider 会丢弃的 reasoning 不会导致过早 compaction。触发时会预留所配置的 provider "
"输出上限（未指定时为 16K）、工具 schema 以及至少 4K 的安全余量。Session 会在同一轮中继续，因此长任务无需停止。"

#: ../../context.md:46
msgid ""
"The context fill shown in the status bar and `/status` is the provider-"
"reported token count of the last request; compaction still triggers on "
"the estimate, which projects the next request."
msgstr ""
"状态栏与 `/status` 显示的上下文占用是最近一次请求的 provider 上报 token "
"数；压缩仍按估算触发，因为估算描述的是下一个请求。"

#: ../../context.md:49
msgid ""
"The checkpoint summary in the active context is lossy, but each "
"compaction also captures a bounded verbatim excerpt of the evicted "
"messages as a **history segment**. Earlier snapshots in the append-only "
"session log remain the cold source of truth, so compaction does not "
"rewrite them."
msgstr ""
"active context 中 checkpoint 的摘要是有损的，但每次 compaction 都会把被淘汰的消息逐字捕获为一个有界的 "
"**history segment**。append-only session 日志中较早的快照仍是冷数据式的真实来源，因此 compaction"
" 不会改写它们。"

#: ../../context.md:55
msgid ""
"Each compaction names the span it evicted, in the same reply that "
"produces the summary, so the title describes the work rather than "
"whichever message happened to start the window. When no name comes back —"
" a summarizer failure trimming the span deterministically — the title "
"falls back to the first user message in it."
msgstr ""
"每次压缩都会在生成摘要的那次回复里为它丢弃的这段对话命名，因此标题描述的是这段工作"
"本身，而不是恰好位于窗口开头的那条消息。如果没有拿到名字——例如摘要失败、只能按确"
"定性方式裁剪——标题会回退为这段对话中的第一条用户消息。"

#: ../../context.md:60
msgid ""
"Segment titles do not occupy every request. The agent uses "
"`RecallContext` to list them newest first, regex-search stored titles and"
" text, or retrieve selected `seg.N` excerpts. `Note` can view the current"
" goal, plan, facts, and checks; updates remain visible in their original "
"tool-call history until a compaction checkpoint consolidates the complete"
" current state."
msgstr ""
"Segment 标题不会占据每次请求。Agent 使用 `RecallContext` "
"按从新到旧的顺序列出标题、通过正则搜索已存储的标题和文本，或取回指定的 `seg.N` 摘录。`Note` 可以查看当前 "
"goal、plan、facts 和 checks；在 compaction checkpoint 汇总完整当前状态之前，更新会保留在原始 "
"tool-call history 中。"

#: ../../context.md:65
msgid ""
"Run `/compact` to compact immediately rather than waiting for the "
"threshold, for example before starting a large refactor. `/status` "
"reports how many compactions a session has done."
msgstr ""
"运行 `/compact` 可以立即压缩，而不必等待阈值；例如可在大型重构前使用。`/status` 会显示当前 session 已执行的 "
"compaction 次数。"

#: ../../context.md:68
msgid ""
"`/compact log` reviews them one by one: each stored segment shows when it"
" was compacted, whether the pass was automatic or manual, whether it "
"covered prior conversation or the running turn, and how much it evicted. "
"Opening one shows the summary that compaction produced at that point, "
"which the active context no longer keeps once a later compaction replaces"
" it. `/compact log seg.N` prints that summary without the viewer. A pass "
"that found nothing to evict stores no segment, so the compaction count "
"can exceed the number of segments."
msgstr ""
"`/compact log` "
"可以逐个回顾这些片段：每个片段会显示压缩发生的时间、这一次是自动还是手动、覆盖的是先前对话还是当前回合，以及丢弃了多少内容。打开某个片段会显示压缩在当时生成的摘要——下一次压缩会把它从活动上下文里替换掉。`/compact"
" log seg.N` 不经查看器直接打印该摘要。没有可丢弃内容的那次压缩不会存储片段，因此压缩次数可能多于片段数量。"

#: ../../context.md:75
msgid ""
"Neither form prints the stored excerpt of the evicted messages; that is "
"the agent's to retrieve with `RecallContext`."
msgstr "两种方式都不会打印已丢弃消息的逐字摘录：那是留给 agent 用 `RecallContext` 取回的。"

#: ../../context.md:78
msgid "Prompt caching"
msgstr "Prompt 缓存"

#: ../../context.md:80
msgid ""
"Prompt caching lets a provider reuse work for an unchanged beginning of a"
" request. The next request usually begins with the same instructions, "
"environment, tools, and earlier conversation, so only the new tail needs "
"to be processed. Note updates and resume events append to the "
"conversation and therefore do not move an earlier breakpoint. A "
"compaction intentionally starts one new cache epoch. Connecting an MCP "
"server, changing installed skills, switching models, or otherwise "
"changing an early section can reduce the next request's cache hit."
msgstr ""
"Prompt 缓存允许 provider "
"复用请求开头未变化部分的计算。下一次请求通常以相同的指令、环境、工具和早期对话开始，因此只需处理新增的尾部。Note 更新和 resume "
"事件会追加到对话中，因此不会移动更早的 breakpoint。一次 compaction 会有意开启新的 cache epoch。连接 MCP "
"server、改变已安装的 skill、切换模型或修改前部内容，都会降低下一次请求的缓存命中。"

#: ../../context.md:89
msgid ""
"A request is reused only up to its first difference, so a change near the"
" beginning — connecting an MCP server, installing a skill, switching "
"models, enabling a provider-side tool — shortens the reusable prefix. "
"That is why the stable sections are placed first."
msgstr ""
"请求只会复用到第一处差异为止，因此靠前的改动——连接 MCP server、安装 skill、切换模型、启用 Provider "
"侧工具——都会缩短可复用前缀。这也是把稳定内容放在最前面的原因。"

#: ../../context.md:94
msgid ""
"OpenAI-compatible providers may reuse matching prefixes automatically; "
"minacode supplies a stable cache key where the provider supports one. For"
" Anthropic, minacode explicitly marks the tools and system instructions "
"as an ephemeral cacheable prefix. Provider support and accounting differ."
msgstr ""
"OpenAI-compatible provider 可以自动复用匹配的前缀；provider 支持时，minacode 会提供稳定的 cache"
" key。对于 Anthropic，minacode 会显式将工具和 system 指令标记为临时可缓存前缀。不同 provider "
"的支持方式和统计口径可能不同。"

#: ../../context.md:98
msgid "Checking the hit rate"
msgstr "检查命中率"

#: ../../context.md:100
msgid ""
"`/status` reports cache-read tokens for the whole session and latest "
"request, plus cache-write tokens when the provider exposes them:"
msgstr ""
"`/status` 会显示整个 session 和最近一次请求的 cache-read token；如果 provider 提供统计，还会显示 "
"cache-write token："

#: ../../context.md:105
msgid ""
"The latest-request ratio also shows live in the status bar, beside the "
"context fill, updating with each response."
msgstr "最近一次请求的命中率也会实时显示在状态栏中，紧跟上下文占用，随每次响应更新。"

#: ../../context.md:108
msgid ""
"The ratio varies with the provider, model, prompt length, and "
"conversation. When request prefixes line up, it <span "
"class=\"marker\">can reach 90–99%</span>. This is an observation, not a "
"guaranteed rate."
msgstr ""
"命中率会随 provider、模型、prompt 长度和对话变化。当前缀保持一致时，<span class=\"marker\">可达到 "
"90–99%</span>。这是观察值，不是保证值。"

